John 14:1 , Christ comforts his disciples with the hope of heaven;
John 14:5 , professes himself the way, the truth, and the life, and one with the Father;
John 14:13 , assures their prayers to be effectual;
John 14:15 , requires obedience;
John 14:16 , promises the Comforter;
John 14:27 , and leaves his peace with them.
